// EntityQueryOptions, actually applied.
//
// This used to be `() => [...players]` — every option thrown away. That is not
// a harmless simplification: core/selector.js exists to turn `@e[type=cow,r=10]`
// into these options, so a stub that ignores them agrees with any filter at all
// and the whole translation went untested. `@a[name=Steve]` returned the world.
//
// Only what can honestly be modelled here is applied. Families need the entity
// type registry, which this stub does not have, so `families`/`excludeFamilies`
